(6) Sales by sales persons selling foods to retail or wholesale stores for resale;
(7) Sales of goods in the manner and in the places described in sections 5.1-21 and 5.1-22 hereof on behalf of an organization, society or association for charitable, religious, patriotic, philanthropic or city purposes or if authorized by the City of Thomson licensees or contractors of such an organization, society or association for such purposes.
(Ord. No. 553, § 1, 7-11-13)

392:
